{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19220","headline":"寄朗州温右史曹长 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄朗州温右史曹长","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂别瑶墀鸳鹭行，彩旗双引到沅湘。\n城边流水桃花过，帘外春风杜若香。\n史笔枉将书纸尾，朝缨不称濯沧浪。\n云台公业家声在，徵诏何时出建章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}